  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The required cylinder is shown in figure<br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/0348486-1235.JPG\" style=\"width: 190px; height: 450px;\" /><br /><br />Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>=</mo></math> current density, then<br /><br />For,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><br />For,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>πr</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>jπ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><br />For,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>πr</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>jπ</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>∝</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math> [this is an equation for rectangular hyperbola.]</p>",
